  "icon": "🏪",
  "description": "The Galley on the River offers fresh cuisine, relaxed dining, and stunning river views right on the Bon Secour River. Whether you arrive by boat at our 70-foot pier or by car, we're the perfect spot for any occasion. We specialize in locally-sourced dishes and handcrafted drinks, from our famous seafood platters and Ahi Tuna Nachos to hand-pressed burgers and wood-fired pizzas. Every visit is a fresh experience. Perfect For: Date night, family dinner, waterfront lunch, group celebrations, or just relaxing with a cold drink by the river.",
